error[marker_mismatch]: `Point(…)` builds a `record`, which keeps a copy of each value: the `@` in `x: @n` says `n` is changed and written back, and only a function's `@` parameter does that (§4.8)
  at tests/golden/full/fixedbugs-412-what-an-at-in-a-construction-is-told.hero:18:18
     |
  18 |     p = Point(x: @n, y: 2)  #~ marker_mismatch
     |                  ^^
  fix (guess): drop the `@`

error[marker_mismatch]: `Pair(…)` builds a `record`, which keeps a copy of each value: the `@` in `rest: @zero` says `zero` is changed and written back, and only a function's `@` parameter does that (§4.8)
  at tests/golden/full/fixedbugs-412-what-an-at-in-a-construction-is-told.hero:19:26
     |
  19 |     q = Pair(a: 1, rest: @zero)  #~ marker_mismatch
     |                          ^^^^^
  note: `rest: zero`, the words that end a construction of a group's `record`, every field it does not name zero, take no `@`
  fix (guess): drop the `@`
